This project uses data collected within the framework of the research initiative
"Bienestar Estudiantil UNAH – II PAC 2025", conducted at the Universidad Nacional
Autónoma de Honduras (UNAH). The underlying dataset is institutional property of
UNAH and is subject to data privacy regulations. Redistribution of the raw data
is not permitted without explicit written authorization from the institution.
 
